<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce Q4 net rises by 68 pct.</title>
<headline>Oce Q4 net rises by 68 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter of 1995/96 year.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.04 vs   2.27</p>
<p>    Net profit			    62.0  vs  37.0</p>
<p>    Total sales (billions)	     1.27 vs   0.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   106.2  vs  69.6</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    25.9  vs  24.1</p>
<p>    Tax				     16.7  vs   9.3</p>
<p>    Div on pref shares		   1.9  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net attributable to ord shrs    60.1  vs  37.0</p>
<p>Note - Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten said it planned to change its name to Oce NV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
